OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused teen 'tends to
OL,4,Aavoid confrontation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of murder after the
OL,7,Fcar he was a passenger in fatally hit a
OL,8,Fman in a feud, would tend to avoid
OL,9,Fconfrontation, a jury has heard.
OL,11,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was crushed by a car
OL,12,Fdriven by Ashton Anderson at a petrol
OL,13,Fstation in Seaham, County Durham, in
OL,14,FJanuary, after months of incidents
OL,15,Fbetween their families, Teesside Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FAnderson, 20, his father Barry, 52, and
OL,19,Fbrother Logan, 19, deny murder, as do
OL,20,FAjay Henry and Tyler Leadbetter, both
OL,21,F18, who were passengers in the car.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
